Package: rcef
Type: Package
Title: Discard Raising and Length/Age Catch Allocation over CEF (RDBES) Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Damian", "Villagra", email = "damian.villagra@ilvo.vlaanderen.be",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yves", "Reecht", role = "aut",
           comment = "RDBESStockCoord functions, vendored (see R/RDBESStockCoord_*.R)"),
    person("RDBESStockCoord contributors", role = "ctb", comment = "ICES WG"))
Description: Implements the ICES discard-raising and length/age catch
    allocation workflows over CEF (RDBES) long-format data: discard-rate
    and sampling-coverage tables with the plots that draw them, plots of
    the numbers and mean weight at length and age, and plots of the
    raised and allocated catch, with one colour palette for all of them.
    Wraps the RDBESStockCoord engines catchRaising() and
    catchAllocationAoL(), and writes what they give in the format of the
    stock coordination (Catch Combined and Distributions Combined).
